  "contentHtml": "<p>AI와 협업을 통해</p><p>좋은 문항을 만들 수 있다! 는 것을</p><p>경험하고 있습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래와 같은 5지 선다형 문항을</p><p>깊은 사고를 촉진할 수 있는 문항으로 수정해 보았습니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7391a96e6a5991df5e85e11ce6761210a386638\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"416\" height=\"289\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7391a96e6a5991df5e85e11ce6761210a386638\" data-origin-width=\"561\" data-origin-height=\"390\"></div><p>&#160; -------------------------------------------------------</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e61a238c85ede1ee2496e50c2b6e85f24d6b7df7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e61a238c85ede1ee2496e50c2b6e85f24d6b7df7\" data-origin-width=\"647\" data-origin-height=\"588\"></div><p>특히 2번 문항이 마음에 들었습니다.</p><p>2번 문항에 대한 답을 물어보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/77abaed9bff9546d4a96cc7fd641ce568fc88342\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"587\" height=\"407\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/77abaed9bff9546d4a96cc7fd641ce568fc88342\" data-origin-width=\"525\" data-origin-height=\"364\"></div><p>---------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에는 관점을 좀 더 융합적인 요소를 포함하였습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5129785a7447351af5740eb20efd104868c76f82\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"540\" height=\"451\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5129785a7447351af5740eb20efd104868c76f82\" data-origin-width=\"617\" data-origin-height=\"515\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0dc79a19e0b237c39ea9bb9e63400b5bf136833a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"509\" height=\"96\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0dc79a19e0b237c39ea9bb9e63400b5bf136833a\" data-origin-width=\"461\" data-origin-height=\"87\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c5e10151deb7c99d5293eef1ff045bdee78fb44\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"616\" height=\"305\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c5e10151deb7c99d5293eef1ff045bdee78fb44\" data-origin-width=\"777\" data-origin-height=\"385\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>----------------------------------------------------------------------</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c420a222872b50ab8bfe38edeae0a9c0c8ed9fb9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"487\" height=\"103\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c420a222872b50ab8bfe38edeae0a9c0c8ed9fb9\" data-origin-width=\"544\" data-origin-height=\"115\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d1b1bd93e36649304584bdad10c784c2906b650\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"638\" height=\"237\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d1b1bd93e36649304584bdad10c784c2906b650\" data-origin-width=\"772\" data-origin-height=\"287\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8539dd66e7b1b9123e4f1cc878cf55eb4326b649\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"636